# @PROJECT_NAME@

This project was generated by `mj2x-cli --generate-xmake`.

Build:

```sh
xmake f -p windows -a x64 -m release
xmake mj2x_native
```

`JAVA_HOME` must point at a JDK with JNI headers.

Layout:

- `src/generated/`: emitted sources (`.c` from StackC/RegC/VMC4, `.cpp` via
  `--emit-cpp`, named by `--emit-c`/`--emit-cpp` when given). The xmake
  project collects every source here.
- `src/mj2x-rt/`: native runtime source pack copied from `mj2x/mj2x-rt`.
  The generated xmake project compiles both C and C++ runtime sources.
